[statement]
A name is decided before the carried name its one candidate needs only if
no package another pending name could choose depends on it: `kw`, the
one candidate for `w`, needs the carried `dep`, but `ku`, the one
candidate for `u`, depends on `w`. `w` waits its turn after `v`, which
goes to `gk`. Contrast `a-sole-candidate-with-a-real-dependency-is-installed-first`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w u

P:ku
V:1
D:w
p:u=1

P:kw
V:1
D:dep
p:v w=1

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install dep 1
install kw 1
install ku 1
install app 1
